  ($qb$HEAIL-AFM-MCQ-018$qb$, $qb$A7-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You need two uninterrupted hours and your workplace is noisy and busy. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Agree with the team a time when you are not to be approached$qb$, $qb$Find a quieter place to work for those hours$qb$, $qb$Come in early before the noise starts$qb$, $qb$Use headphones and work through it$qb$, $qb$Try harder to concentrate despite the noise$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
