  ($qb$HEAIL-AFM-MCQ-026$qb$, $qb$A7-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$Your best hours for demanding work are the first two of the day. Meetings are being booked into them. What is best?$qb$, $qb$Ask for those two hours to be kept clear and say why$qb$, $qb$Book the hours in your calendar so they show as busy$qb$, $qb$Do demanding work at another time instead$qb$, $qb$Accept the meetings and work later in the day$qb$, $qb$Ask for meetings to be shorter$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
  ($qb$HEAIL-AFM-MCQ-027$qb$, $qb$A7-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$You keep starting a long piece of work and stopping. What is most likely to keep you going?$qb$, $qb$Knowing what the next small step is at every point$qb$, $qb$Working on it at the same time each day$qb$, $qb$Setting a target for how far to get$qb$, $qb$Telling someone you are working on it$qb$, $qb$Waiting until you have a clear run at it$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
