  ($qb$HEAIL-AFM-MCQ-031$qb$, $qb$A7-06$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$What is the main weakness of relying on willpower to stay focused?$qb$, $qb$It has to be spent again every time$qb$, $qb$It varies from day to day$qb$, $qb$It runs out as the day goes on$qb$, $qb$It works less well when you are tired$qb$, $qb$It cannot be shared with others$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
