  ($qb$HEAIL-AFM-SJT-037$qb$, $qb$A7-06$qb$, $qb$SJT$qb$, $qb$You work at a coach booking office. The counter, the phone and the booking system all need attention and you have made three booking errors this week. How do you respond?$qb$, $qb$Ask for the phone to be covered during counter hours$qb$, $qb$Slow down at the counter to reduce errors$qb$, $qb$Check each booking twice before confirming$qb$, $qb$Ask colleagues to be quieter at the counter$qb$, $qb$Concentrate harder when all three are busy$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
