  ($qb$HEAIL-EMB-MCQ-028$qb$, $qb$A7-07$qb$, $qb$MCQ$qb$, $qb$What is the main problem with a team where nobody takes their full holiday?$qb$, $qb$The workload has quietly become larger than the team$qb$, $qb$People become tired over time$qb$, $qb$Holiday builds up and has to be paid$qb$, $qb$Nobody is trained to cover for anyone$qb$, $qb$It sets a poor example$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, 0, true),
